  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Finance for Established Agri-Businesses</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">17.	This ICF component will create deep partnerships with a small number of banks, financial intermediaries and/or fund managers to increase access to finance for agribusinesses through a mixture of relevant financial products for the agricultural sector. It will incentivise lenders and investors to promote green activities (for example resilient seeds, irrigation, solar pumps).</narrative>
  </description>
